OL,4,BClashes mar European games as Macron   
OL,5,Bcondemns violence                      
OL,6,GViolent clashes marred a number of     
OL,7,GEuropean football matches on Thursday  
OL,8,Gnight, with French President Emmanuel  
OL,9,GMacron condemning trouble at           
OL,10,GMarseille's home game against Levski   
OL,11,GSofia.                                 
OL,13,FThere were also incidents at games     
OL,14,Fbetween Turkish side Besiktas and      
OL,15,FIsrael's Hapoel Be'er-Sheva in Georgia 
OL,16,Fand Sunderland's 1-1 home draw with    
OL,17,FPoland's Jagiellonia Bialystok.        
